OL,3,AZelensky says intelligence sharing on
OL,4,ARussian strikes 'works now' and Ukraine
OL,5,A'thankful' to US
OL,6,
OL,7,FVolodymyr Zelensky says he is "ready
OL,8,Ffor negotiations" after talks with US
OL,9,Fspecial envoy Steve Witkoff
OL,11,FZelensky calls for trilateral talks
OL,12,Fwith the US and Russia, and says
OL,13,FWitkoff is going to Russia tomorrow.
OL,15,FThe pair met in Oslo amid deteriorating
OL,16,Frelations between the Ukrainian leader
OL,17,Fand US President Donald Trump
OL,19,FFinnish President Alexander Stubb and
OL,20,FNorwegian PM Jonas Gahr StC8re were
OL,21,Falongside Zelensky at a news briefing
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
