OL,5,A'thankful' to US
OL,6,
OL,7,FStubb says today's talks made "genuine
OL,8,Fprogress" and they "found some elements
OL,9,Fof peace"
OL,11,FEarlier, US Secretary of State Marco
OL,12,FRubio branded accusations that
OL,13,FUkrainians were dying because the US
OL,14,Fwas withholding intelligence from Kyiv
OL,15,Fas "scandalous"
